.* RECOVERY: the task menu for optical backup and recovery.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='RECOVERY'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=RECOVERY HELP=HLPRECOVERY KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Optical Backup/Recovery
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKHLDOPTF'.Work with held optical files
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?RCLOPT'.Reclaim optical index
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?CPYOPT'.Copy to optical backup
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?CPYOPT'.Copy from optical backup
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKOPTVOL'.Work with backup volumes
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?CVTOPTBKU'.Convert optical backup volume
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?DUPOPT'.Duplicate optical volume
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?CHKOPTVOL'.Check optical volume
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPRECOVERY.Optical Backup/Recovery - Help
:P.Keeping copies of optical volumes and repairing them.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
